files listed in part 3. That is: src/core, src/gfx, src/audio, src/input, src/ui, src/main.cpp,
src/framework/interp.cpp and interp.h, tools, tests, the build files, res/ and the documentation
(all original work; the engine layers come from Hopmon Native, by the same author).

