2. Reconstructed game code: NOT covered by the MIT License
----------------------------------------------------------

  src/game/       reconstruction of the game logic of Mage Bros.,
                  (c) 2003-2009 Saito Games
  src/framework/  (except interp.cpp/interp.h) reconstruction of the DirectX 7 SDK
                  sample framework the game was built on, (c) Microsoft Corporation,
                  with Saito Games' modifications (shared with Hopmon Native)

These files reproduce the behaviour and structure of the original program so that it can
run on modern systems. The rights to that original work belong to its owners, and no
license to it is granted here. Native additions inside these folders are marked "Native"
in the source comments.

Mage Bros., its name, artwork, levels, sounds and music are (c) Saito Games, and its MIDI
music is (c) Yamaha Corporation. None of them are included in this repository; they are
read at runtime from the user's own copy of the freeware game.


3. Third-party code
-------------------

The files in third_party/ keep their own licenses, listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:

  third_party/coldet/  ColDet 1.2, (c) 2000 Amir Geva, GNU LGPL version 2 or later
                       (third_party/coldet/COPYING). The collision library the original
                       game was built with, included unmodified.
  third_party/*.h, *.c TinySoundFont, dr_libs, stb, cgltf, font8x8 (MIT / public domain).

SDL3 (zlib license) is downloaded at build time, not included.
